      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `6e65f385023a9037bca79e8c85210587d6b31eccea7d758824ec4f165f36a20d--4515DC001_201112.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Federal Defendants, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2011-12\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 16 of 16\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | fd4aca060eeacca12a5fc3b825f2eb48e83be921c0b2998fbd413f5a2ee65ccf | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 5c83f2700b2c25787cc79a82f45fe489eadbe0a6c841fc3295018098e8c418d1 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 3351a0bbf4fc0686975bc9e50e62d8f677ada5536517e87bfeb3f7f39cdb1e25 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 34ac7bfeef67c5b58f6c425ce589b9207b9fa98cf10454dde42a0911ea452d87 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 9e626def148701e080e735e705d55b5eb692a3071e3c14eb329382aafe93bbdc | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | cb4112d6df2a82cc3d854cd945e87f9d72532f8d774cbb443c9f3a7bc071ff65 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | d4d954065840e8b4462fa041ae440795cad331f3c8503a15fef656eed95c089b | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 3f16e60f6d4d5a7e72049c7bc2b5dd7054da3e35d58f85bce095a58abf3b47c1 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 297a3c7e9c7178e91d1ac8f95045498e6d450b93199171693efad211b41728a0 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 9743ca5868f8e14cada74e4205a90b6e722e3ece7e80eb16a254270e547923e7 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | f020c06012d300d7156362f5993fea2a0bd01e9fb998913ca9986697a03eeb14 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 7ce16a58ac49614afa8ad3561ac968948d0baa006e9f5c941340a159f8e9b089 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | dcfdd7b1ec44938d61f98314b17500378ba34c4dc4979b12b7369a11cfd79226 | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | b9fc1a875676b2d52141b4f497de0f03304de25267b29d9660bfc57ce954f220 | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | ed1477a42e29f9d2eca06581b250f803e1922ee9e8218e84ac2168680038bbb3 | missing |\n| \"Table_15\" | fcf97d7b9960f4e99e0414c48e30d05a08a55ec150c7c67798995df644926d50 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemo